# The import page while it runs (DECKATLAS_DEMO=import-hold: a 10,326-tile folder converted at 800 tiles/s, held at
# 40 % until Cancel): the bar, the count, the rate and the time left, Cancel by touch, the stopped state.
title Import: progress, Cancel
sizes 640x480 480x320 320x480 480x800
env DECKATLAS_DEMO import-hold
env DECKATLAS_VIEW 48.886392,2.27417,15

wait 600
key tab
wait 600
key down
key down
key enter
wait 800
key enter
wait 800
key enter
wait 800
key enter
wait 500
key enter
wait 3500
shot importing
expect text "Converting tiles"
expect text "Cancel"
tap "Cancel"
wait 800
shot import-stopped
expect text "Import stopped"
expect text "Back"
key esc
wait 500
expect text "Import a map"
key esc
expect quit
